DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: CROSSCOUNTRY INTERMEDIATE HOLDCO LLC (CCM)\nRoadshow: https://www.
 netroadshow.com/events/login/1PeTHmohCH8jtwHRGDlGCFpkJOYn6sbEwUmcL\n\nDeal
  context:\nCrossCountry Intermediate HoldCo\, LLC is bringing a $500 milli
 on 5-year Senior Unsecured Notes offering to market\, rated Ba3/BB- at the
  corporate level and B1/BB- at the issue level (Moody's/Fitch)\, with init
 ial price talk of 8% to low-8s. The deal is distributed as 144A/Reg S for 
 Life with NC-2 call protection and an equity clawback of up to 40% at par 
 plus coupon for the first two years. Proceeds will be used to repay borrow
 ings under the MSR (Mortgage Servicing Rights) Facilities\, reflecting the
  company's mortgage origination business\, with joint bookrunners led by C
 iti (Left Lead) alongside GS\, JPM\, MS\, BNS\, WFS\, RBC\, and TSI.
